  },
  {
    q: 'What is the difference between SSC JE and RRB JE?',
    a: 'SSC JE recruits Junior Engineers across general central government departments (CPWD, MES, and others) through two objective papers with no interview. RRB JE recruits specifically for Indian Railways through a two-stage CBT plus document verification and medical exam. Eligibility, syllabus depth, and pay scales differ slightly, so read each notification separately rather than assuming they are interchangeable.',
