  </div>

  <h2 id="checkpoint">Use The 4-Checkpoint Protocol before you pick one route</h2>

  <p>
    Six routes is still too many to chase at once. The 4-Checkpoint Protocol narrows it down in
    one honest sitting.
  </p>

